Third-party components
----------------------

Release builds of pshell bundle boto3 and its transitive dependencies,
including botocore, jmespath, s3transfer, python-dateutil, urllib3, and
certifi. These components are provided under their respective upstream
licenses. License and package metadata are included in the vendor directories
inside the pshell executable archive.

"AWS", "Amazon Web Services", "boto3", "botocore", and "S3" are names or
